model/dataset you enable. See docs/licenses.md for the per-component matrix.

CRITICAL: The MANO hand model (https://mano.is.tue.mpg.de) is licensed for
NON-COMMERCIAL scientific research ONLY and is gated behind registration. Every
MANO-based hand estimator (HaMeR, WiLoR, Hamba, WildHands, Dyn-HaMR, ...) and
every MANO-parameterized dataset annotation inherits that restriction. ego2dex
never vendors MANO weights; you must download MANO_RIGHT.pkl / MANO_LEFT.pkl
yourself after accepting the MANO license.
